    <string name="export_title">Export for tuning</string>
    <string name="export_body">Builds a redacted summary of the messages that could not be categorised, so the rules can be improved.\n\nAmounts, account numbers, names, phone numbers, dates and links are replaced with placeholders. Personal messages and OTPs are left out entirely. Names from your contacts are removed from every message. You will see exactly what it contains before anything is shared, and can add any words the rules missed.</string>
